I am in the supermarket.
There are rice and dal in my cart.
Now I want coffee.
I like coffee a lot in the morning.
But where is the coffee?
I look here and there.
I do not find the coffee shelf.
I see a shop worker.
I go to him.
I say, "Excuse me, bhaiya."
He looks towards me.
I ask, "Bhaiya, I want coffee."
"Where are the hot drinks?"
He smiles and points.
He says, "Madam, the coffee is there."
"It is in aisle number three."
I thank him.
I go into aisle number three.
There are many kinds of coffee there.
I take a coffee for myself.
